      {
        "description": "The synthetic dataset comprises 8 million formal statements with proofs.",
        "item_id": null,
        "source_chunk_id": "07afd94469ac228a52ed",
        "source_excerpt": "After fine-tuning the DeepSeekMath 7B model on this synthetic dataset, which comprises 8 million formal statements with proofs",
        "source_excerpt_verified": false
      },
      {
        "description": "DeepSeek-Prover achieved 60.2% cumulative pass@k on miniF2F-valid.",
        "item_id": null,
        "source_chunk_id": "47ccb9da76972f714f91",
        "source_excerpt": "DeepSeek-Prover outperforms all with cumulative scores of 60.2% on miniF2F-valid and 52.0% on miniF2F-test",
        "source_excerpt_verified": false
      },
      {
        "description": "The base model is DeepSeekMath-Base 7B, a decoder-only transformer pre-trained on 120 billion math-related tokens.",
        "item_id": null,
        "source_chunk_id": "1d256a373c79f8f433f8",
        "source_excerpt": "DeepSeek-Prover is built upon DeepSeekMath-Base 7B model [Shao et al., 2024], a decoder-only transformer [Vaswani et al., 2017] pre-trained on a corpus comprising 120 billion math-related tokens.",
        "source_excerpt_verified": true
      },
      {
        "description": "The autoformalization dataset consists of 869,659 high-quality natural language math problems scraped from online resources.",
        "item_id": null,
        "source_chunk_id": "5afda7095fa2f6fafef6",
        "source_excerpt": "we employed web scraping and careful data cleaning techniques to extract problems from online resources featuring high school and undergraduate exercises, exams, and competitions, resulting in a dataset of 869,659 high-quality natural language math problems.",
        "source_excerpt_verified": true
      },
      {
        "description": "After quality filtering, 712,073 high-quality formal statements were obtained.",
        "item_id": null,
        "source_chunk_id": "b2b02f05a074961d7840",
        "source_excerpt": "By applying this dual strategy of model scoring and hypothesis rejection, we curated a refined set of 712,073 high-quality formal statements",
        "source_excerpt_verified": true
      },
      {
        "description": "The model was fine-tuned with global batch size 512, constant learning rate 1e-4, and 6000 warmup steps.",
        "item_id": null,
        "source_chunk_id": "1d256a373c79f8f433f8",
        "source_excerpt": "We fine-tuned this model using a global batch size of 512 and a constant learning rate of 1 × 10−4, incorporating 6,000 warmup steps with synthetic data.",
        "source_excerpt_verified": true
      },
      {
        "description": "The approach uses dual concurrent proof searches for each statement and its negation to improve efficiency.",
        "item_id": null,
        "source_chunk_id": "b2b02f05a074961d7840",
        "source_excerpt": "We implemented dual concurrent proof searches for each synthetic statement—one for the statement Γ ⊢P and another for its negation Γ ⊢¬P.",
        "source_excerpt_verified": true
      },
      {
        "description": "The work focuses on algebra and number theory at middle school and undergraduate levels, with plans to expand diversity.",
        "item_id": null,
        "source_chunk_id": "8dc5afca74bdf46d8cba",
        "source_excerpt": "Currently, our work mainly focuses on algebra and number theory at the middle school and undergraduate levels. In future work, we will aim to expand the diversity of mathematical problems addressed",
        "source_excerpt_verified": true
      }
    ],
